{"2637080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crafty Racer", "steam_appid": 2637080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ultimate Creative Racing Battle Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your imagination in <strong>Crafty Racer</strong>! Build anything you can dream of using a block-based editor. From sleek high-speed <strong>karts</strong> and heavy-duty <strong>trucks</strong> to literal <strong>animals</strong> on wheels. If you can build it, you can race it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wreck your friends in your own custom Battle Arenas!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/76feea4297a556ac70a7568dd1231c17.poster.avif?t=1786959697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/76feea4297a556ac70a7568dd1231c17.webm?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/76feea4297a556ac70a7568dd1231c17.mp4?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 in local Split Screen multiplayer</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Your Own Animated Tracks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.poster.avif?t=1786959697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.webm?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/d0aab8f771f1ae77fd0cf2bccd6b5e26.mp4?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Freedom:</strong> Create tracks from scratch in diverse themes like tropical beaches, messy bedrooms, or high-tech workshops. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Hazards:</strong> Place jumps, swinging obstacles, and custom traps to challenge your rivals. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic &amp; Mechanics:</strong> Use advanced tools to animate rotations, movements, and spawning objects for a truly living world. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your own animated Vehicles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.poster.avif?t=1786959697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.webm?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/16e8e428f975b41a86257cbd762bf674.mp4?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for a standard car? Choose a base and customize your ride:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Karts, Buggies</strong> and <strong>Heavy Trucks</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or any Wacky Creations like a motorized <strong>sofa</strong>, a <strong>tiger-rover</strong>, a blox car. Anything is possible!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft Your animated characters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.poster.avif?t=1786959697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.webm?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/dd8b4b0778f995be53e8866f0d3e1e9d.mp4?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize any character or create your own. Bring any idea you can imagine to life, like a creature with a robot body and two animal heads. You choose!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to race? Go! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.poster.avif?t=1786959697\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.webm?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2637080/extras/126fdbc7bbe5e8abc482edf30d0a0860.mp4?t=1786959697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform stunts, push, and rush to the finish line as fast as you can!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win tracks and models. Race as much as you want with endless fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race solo or up to 4 players!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/26